1. ten Floats with inject(:+): 0.9999999999999999   == 1 is false
2. ten Floats with sum:        1.0   == 1 is true (sum compensates; inject does not)
3. ten Rationals:              (1/1)   == 1 is true
4. ten BigDecimals:            1.0   == 1 is true
5. 19.99 * 3: Float 59.97, Rational (5997/100), BigDecimal 59.97
